  {
   "beat": "S01",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 15.06,
   "text": "Hi, I am Dhrumil Shah, and this video is about Phase 3 of my Mycroft project, where I expanded the system by building a modular multi-agent financial analytics architecture for market structure analysis, anomaly detection, peer benchmarking, tail risk and liquidity analysis, and prediction reliability."
  },
  {
   "beat": "S02",
   "start": 16.64,
   "end": 18.72,
   "text": "Phase 3 begins with a reusable agent framework."
  },
  {
   "beat": "S02",
   "start": 19.38,
   "end": 21.42,
   "text": "Agent config holds shared settings and thresholds."
  },
  {
   "beat": "S02",
   "start": 22.3,
   "end": 26.52,
   "text": "Shared context is a namespace blackboard where agents publish and require each other's output."
  },
